OL,3,ABinance users withdraw $3.6bn after
OL,4,Arecord crypto hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FBinance customers withdrew a net
OL,7,F$3.64bn (#2.72bn) of assets from the
OL,8,Fworld's largest cryptocurrency exchange
OL,9,Fas it reopened on Sunday following a
OL,10,Frecord hack last week.
OL,12,FThe firm suspended all transactions in
OL,13,Fthe wake of the incident, which
OL,14,Fimpacted $6.3bn worth of digital
OL,15,Fassets.
OL,17,FMajor organisations, including the US
OL,18,FFederal Bureau of Investigation (FBI),
OL,19,Fhave accused North Korea of being
OL,20,Fresponsible for the cyber attack, which
OL,21,Fis said to be the largest hack in
OL,22,Fhistory.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
